Fermat-Catalan style exponent budget
  box=2 <= p <= q <= r <= 10
  counts: hyperbolic=150 boundary=3 elliptic=12
  first_hyperbolic_triples=[(3, 3, 4), (2, 4, 5), (3, 3, 5), (3, 4, 4), (2, 3, 7), (2, 4, 6), (2, 5, 5), (3, 3, 6), (3, 4, 5), (4, 4, 4), (2, 3, 8), (2, 4, 7)]
  LRC use: if a residual packet needs simultaneous additive, multiplicative, and valuation exponents in the hyperbolic region, record it as finite-exception debt rather than a free scalar.

